<title>USA: Illinois direct hogs weak/off $0.50 - USDA.</title>
<headline>Illinois direct hogs weak/off $0.50 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>SPRINGFIELD 1997-04-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA said barrows and gilts were weak to $0.50 lower. Demand was moderate for a light moderate run. Top $56.50 per cwt.</p>
<p>US 1-2 230-260 lbs. 55.00-56.00, few 56.50</p>
<p>Sows - generally steady. Top $50.00.</p>
<p>US 1-3 Under 400 lbs. 40.00-45.00</p>
<p>	     400-500 lbs. 43.00-45.00, few 450-500 lbs. 47.00</p>
<p>	     500-600 lbs. 46.00-49.00</p>
<p>	     few over 600 lbs. 48.00-50.00</p>
</text>
